# Flight's only target is checked as it resolves (CR 608.2b). Bot2 bolts Bot1's Memnite in response: Memnite is gone, so the
# spell does not resolve (Flight, a spell, still goes to the graveyard).

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Memnite
Island
Fleeting Flight
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x14

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Fleeting Flight.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Memnite)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Bot1.Graveyard = Fleeting Flight; Memnite
